    {
      "id": "eca201906eccda603aeba6255f753436",
      "url": "https://fmhy.net/posts/aug-2026",
      "title": "Monthly Updates [August]",
      "content": "<div class=\"info custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">INFO</p>\n<p>These update threads only contain major updates. If you're interested\nin seeing all minor changes you can follow our\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fmhy/FMHYedit/commits/main\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Commits Page</a> on GitHub or\n<a href=\"https://redd.it/17f8msf\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Updates Channel</a> in Discord.</p>\n</div>\n<h1 id=\"wiki-updates\" tabindex=\"-1\">Wiki Updates <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#wiki-updates\"></a></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Added <strong><a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/kVdvPwnc/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">URL Search Support</a></strong> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/v13FI4y.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, you can now search entire URLs or text inside URLs. Disabled by default, press the link icon in the search bar to enable. TY to @Lou, @Manu, &amp; @Bread for making this happen.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added a <strong><a href=\"https://search.fmhy.bid/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Semantic Style Search</a></strong> for FMHY, should work well with natural language. TY to @Zenith for making this.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added a new theme called <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/QjFYWTw9/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Monolith</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/fwZMOCw.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>. Uses JetBrains Mono, targeted at HiDPI monitors. TY to @Zenith for making this.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added a <a href=\"https://d.fmhy.bid/rss.xml\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">RSS Style Changelog Tracker</a>. Thank you to @Zenith for making this.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Split Reading Recommendations into 3 subsections: <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/reading#book-recommendations\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Books</a> / <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/reading#comic-recommendations\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Comics</a> / <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/reading#manga-recommendations\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Manga</a>. TY to @Dan for doing this.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added section for <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/video#iptv-players\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IPTV Players</a> to Video Tools, TY to @RansomQ for doing this.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added section for <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/social-media-tools#tiktok-tools\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TikTok Tools</a> to Social Media.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Re-ordered stream aggregators based on the results (and conversations) that took place during <a href=\"https://challonge.com/rtdxi8qg/fullscreen\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">the polls for it</a>. Thank you to everyone who voted. <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/VYsz7PbR/Untitled.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Before vs After</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/XS9RUNN.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Re-ordered Game Repack Sites based on the results from the poll, thank you to everyone who voted. <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/MyyqwQ6z/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Before vs After</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/shPiyop.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Changed the currently focused search and scroll-to-match highlights to use <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/39z3CZDv/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">theme colors</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/UNHsaiZ.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h1 id=\"stars-added-\u2b50\" tabindex=\"-1\">Stars Added \u2b50 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#stars-added-\u2b50\"></a></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/file-tools#file-hosts\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0807</a> in File Hosts, 10GB, keeps files 90 days (after last download), has a good dev team + has been well received so far.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/gaming#download-games\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ZeiGames</a> (formerly RexaGames) in Game Downloads, big library, fast hosts, update games quickly.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/gaming#rom-sites\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LoLROMs</a> in ROM section, newer collection, covers both popular and obscure consoles, has thousands of games + single click downloads.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/gaming-tools#game-mods\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thunderstore</a> is Game Mods, mods + mod manager mostly for Unity Games (but has others too), has a big library, preferred over Nexus by some.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/reading#book-tracking-databases\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">StoryGraph</a> in Book Recommendations, book tracking / recommendation site, very feature rich, preferred over GoodReads by some.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/reading#comic-recommendations\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Comic Book Reading Orders</a> in Comic Recommendations, massive catalog of reading orders, going all the back to the 60's.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/reading#book-recommendations\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The Book Prize Index</a>, nice index of book awards + award winning books.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/gaming-tools#optimization-tools\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OptiScaler</a> in Optimization Tools, game upscaling tool for windows, uses games motion vectors for better results, has no screen warping like Lossless Scaling.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/video#download-sites\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MKV BASE</a> in Movies/TV Downloading, has very big library + good hosts.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/video#anime-streaming\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Yeanime</a> in Anime Streaming, has a nice UI, fast streams, seems to be well liked.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/internet-tools#redirect-bypass\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bypass (lc)</a> in Redirect Bypass, works well, supports many sites.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/privacy#search-engines\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Startpage</a> in Privacy Search Engines, essentially a google frontend with better privacy, has better results in some cases than other privacy engines.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h1 id=\"things-removed\" tabindex=\"-1\">Things Removed <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#things-removed\"></a></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Removed Cromite as its now 3 major chromium versions behind, has many bugs, and the dev has said they're taking a break, we'll re-add in the future if it makes a comeback.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added Nightcord to our unsafe list, they seem to of been caught <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/gbG0SYhM/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">logging discord tokens</a> in the past. Note we didn't have this listed on FMHY, we just want to help get the info out there.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
